\f0\fs32 \cf0 SCM Workbench\
\fs20 A local, self-contained UI for silhouette-card-maker and scm-extras.\
\
\fs18 Everything the app keeps - settings, images, decklists, the private\
Python runtime and job history - lives in its own data folder:\
\fs20 ~/Library/Application Support/scm-workbench\
\fs18 An update can never touch that folder, so a new version can't lose\
your work.\
\
Check for new versions any time in Settings -> "App updates".\
The app checks on its own at start-up, and once a day while it's open.\
\
\fs16 github.com/mallen86/scm-workbench
